    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazwi la iNkosi yawakhuluma ngelizwi elikhulu emhlanganweni wenu entabeni iphakathi komlilo leyezi lomnyama omkhulu; kayengezelelanga lutho kuwo. Yawaloba ematsheni amabili, yanginika wona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lilizwa ilizwi elivela phakathi komnyama, lentaba ivutha umlilo, lasondela kimi lina lonke zinhloko zezizwe lani lonke balisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lathi: Khangelani, iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu isitshengisile inkazimulo yayo lobukhulu bayo, salizwa lelizwi layo livela phakathi komlilo; lamhla sibonile ukuthi umuntu angakhuluma loNkulunkulu aphile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke sizafelani na? Ngoba lumlilo omkhulu uzasiqothula. Uba siphinda silizwa ilizwi leNkosi futhi, sizakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngubani ebantwini bonke owezwa ilizwi likaNkulunkulu ophilayo likhuluma livela emlilweni, njengalokhu silizwile thina, waphila na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sondela wena, uzwe konke iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu ezakukutsho, usitshele konke ekutshiloyo kuwe, ukuba sikuzwe, sizakukwenza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi isiwezwile amazwi enu eliwakhulume kimi, yathi: Ngizwile amazwi alababantu abawakhulume kuwe; lokho abakukhulumileyo kuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungathi bangaba lenhliziyo enjalo insuku zonke, ukuba bangesabe, bagcine yonke imilayo yami, ukuze kubalungele bona labantwana babo kuze kube nininini! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamba uyekuthi kibo: Buyelani emathenteni enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
