        {
          "text": "Kodwa wena, mana lapha phansi kwami, ngizakutshela yonke imithetho lezimiso lezahlulelo ozakubafundisa zona, ukuze bazenze elizweni engibanika lona libe ngelabo. ",
          "type": "text",
